  "historyNote": "#2261, eff 1-17-83; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86; rpld by #4516, eff 10-28-88; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92 New. #5511, eff 11-25-92; amd by #5665, eff 7-14-93; ss by #6895, INTERIM, eff 11-26-98, EXPIRED: 3-26-99 New. #9121, eff 4-3-08, EXPIRED: 4-3-16 New. #12047, INTERIM, eff 11-19-16, EXPIRED: 5-18-17 New. #12414, eff 11-3-17; ss by #13339, eff 1-29-22",
